GIVEN item IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE `sch 4 row`
`sch 4 part 5 the row for the item` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF item EQUALS "1" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 1 row`
        IF item EQUALS "1(a)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 1(a) row`
        IF item EQUALS "1(b)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 1(b) row`
        IF item EQUALS "1(c)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 1(c) row`
        IF item EQUALS "1(d)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 1(d) row`
        IF item EQUALS "2" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 2 row`
        IF item EQUALS "3" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 3 row`
        IF item EQUALS "3(a)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 3(a) row`
        IF item EQUALS "3(b)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 3(b) row`
        IF item EQUALS "4" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 4 row`
        IF item EQUALS "4(a)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 4(a) row`
        IF item EQUALS "4(b)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 4(b) row`
        IF item EQUALS "5" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 5 row`
        IF item EQUALS "5(a)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 5(a) row`
        IF item EQUALS "5(b)" THEN JUST `sch 4 part 5 item 5(b) row`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Fourth Schedule has no such item in this Part

-- ===========================================================================
§ `Fourth Schedule Part 5 -- what the text says besides the table`
-- ===========================================================================

-- src:8767 | Service provision fees relating to Admiralty matters must be paid in the manner set out in the table below or at any such other time or manner that the Registrar of the Supreme Court may determine. Item
@ref Sch 4 part 5 (src:8767)
GIVEN `the fee is a service provision fee relating to Admiralty matters in Part 5` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the fee is paid in the manner set out in the table` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the fee is paid at the time or in the manner the Registrar of the Supreme Court has determined` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 4 part 5 the Admiralty service provision fee is paid as the Schedule requires` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the fee is a service provision fee relating to Admiralty matters in Part 5`)
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Service provision fees relating to Admiralty matters must be paid"
    ELSE IF `the fee is paid in the manner set out in the table` OR `the fee is paid at the time or in the manner the Registrar of the Supreme Court has determined`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): a bare "must be paid"; the Schedule does not say what follows

-- Item 2: "commission of 5% to be charged on the first $1,000 and 2½% upon all above that sum, such sum to include the auctioneer's or broker's commission".
-- src:8794 | 2.
-- src:8795 | On the sale of a ship or goods, commission of 5% to be charged on the first $1,000 and 2½% upon all above that sum, such sum to include the auctioneer’s or broker’s commission
-- src:8796 | To be deducted by Sheriff
@ref Sch 4 part 5 item 2 (src:8794-8796)
GIVEN `the proceeds of the sale` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`sch 4 part 5 item 2 the commission on the sale` MEANS
    (5 TIMES (min `the proceeds of the sale` 1000) DIVIDED BY 100) PLUS (2.5 TIMES (max (`the proceeds of the sale` MINUS 1000) 0) DIVIDED BY 100)

-- Item 3: "commission of $500 plus 10 cents a ton to be charged for every month during arrest or any part of a month"; the tonnage is net registered, or gross if net is not ascertained.
-- src:8797 | 3.
-- src:8798 | On the release of a ship or goods from arrest, commission of $500 plus 10 cents a ton to be charged for every month during arrest or any part of a month
-- src:8799 | To be paid to the Sheriff by the party requesting the arrest
-- src:8800 | Note : In the case of a ship, the commission is calculated on —
-- src:8801 | ( a )
-- src:8802 | the net registered tonnage of the ship at the time the commission becomes payable
-- src:8803 | ( b )
-- src:8804 | if the net registered tonnage of the ship has not been ascertained, the gross tonnage of the ship at the time the commission becomes payable
@ref Sch 4 part 5 item 3 (src:8797-8804)
GIVEN `the net registered tonnage of the ship at the time the commission becomes payable` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the gross tonnage of the ship at the time the commission becomes payable` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of months during arrest, counting any part of a month as a month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`sch 4 part 5 item 3 the commission on the release of a ship` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the net registered tonnage of the ship at the time the commission becomes payable`
    WHEN JUST net THEN (500 PLUS 0.1 TIMES net) TIMES `the number of months during arrest, counting any part of a month as a month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN (500 PLUS 0.1 TIMES `the gross tonnage of the ship at the time the commission becomes payable`) TIMES `the number of months during arrest, counting any part of a month as a month`
